---
/**
 * The body of every inner page: the page's `PageHeader` in the `header` slot,
 * the content under it, and the container and space around both. A page that
 * wants a rail beside its content lays out its own grid and gives the rail
 * the `rail` class (global.css).
 */
---

<div class="page-wrap pt-8 pb-16 md:pt-10 md:pb-24">
  <div class="pb-8">
    <slot name="header" />
  </div>
  <slot />
</div>
